           "ai_hint": "A speed-for-fidelity trade, never a quality improvement -- it only removes work. Suggest 0.08 when the user explicitly wants a Qwen-Image-2.1 render faster and can accept some softening of fine detail; 0.15 only if they ask for aggressive speed. Keep it at 0.0 for final renders.",
